[00:02.000] 制作人 : Justin Meldal-Johnsen
[00:11.330]I sat and reflected on the only photo
[00:21.857]At your funeral, on the easel
[00:29.379]In the shadow of the willowed Sacred Heart
[00:41.755]Where we started wanting, weeding
[00:51.933]Southern autumn, places of your life overgrown
[00:59.600]Warm winds blow
[01:03.432]Secrets we die with trembling weakness
[01:08.566]Is what haunts us now
[01:14.247]Inside the windows what once made us proud
[01:19.441]I owned everything thought to be suicidal mania
[01:30.155]I was everything taught to me
[01:35.259]Drinking deeply, the truth of my grief
[01:48.194]But what else could be?
[01:51.516]Everything was written
[01:56.387]I saw everybody plead
[02:02.359]I owned everything thought to be suicidal mania
[02:12.546]I was everything taught to me
[02:17.971]Drinking deeply, the truth of my grief
[02:34.687]Show me now everything that I oﬀer
[02:39.515]I saw my own father lay the ground beneath me
[02:56.857]I owned everything thought to be
[03:02.250]I was everything taught to me
[03:12.719]All the tapes and all of the letters
[03:23.214]At Heaven's gate standing with the guards
[03:31.861]My love is endless
[03:36.759]Everything of you is me, every step is toward the grave
[03:50.104]Could it be flesh and blood were all we gave?
